From c9fd97f60231be5fe7c5ba14c009a9622bb42197 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mariah Gardziola <mgardziola@adobe.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Jun 2025 22:15:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: improve grid-marquee block with responsive design and
 design tokens

- Add comprehensive radius design tokens (--corner-radius-*)
- Implement fluid responsive grid using ax-grid system
- Update mobile ax-grid-margin to 16px for better spacing
- Optimize card padding: 8px mobile, 12px tablet, 16px desktop
- Unwrap images from paragraph tags for semantic HTML
- Apply 8px border-radius consistently using --corner-radius-100
- Ensure video maintains 4:3 aspect ratio across all breakpoints
- Fix drawer functionality on mobile/tablet
- Replace hardcoded px values with spacing/radius tokens
- Improve video container spacing with proper padding structure
---
 .../code/blocks/grid-marquee/grid-marquee.css | 241 +++++++++++-------
 .../code/blocks/grid-marquee/grid-marquee.js  |  11 +
 express/code/styles/styles.css                |  16 +-
 3 files changed, 176 insertions(+), 92 deletions(-)

